# 本地运行时数据（账户快照/交易日志/shadow 账户等含敏感信息）
metrics/data/
# Exceptions (5/9 fix for "数据不足" + "本周无平仓"):
#   - daily_snapshot.csv: needed for benchmark_tracker (≥2 rows)
#   - trade_journal.csv:  needed for weekly_review (本周复盘)
# GHA runners are ephemeral; without these tracked, both reports silently break.
# Paper-trading equity is non-sensitive enough to commit.
!metrics/data/daily_snapshot.csv
!metrics/data/trade_journal.csv
test_dashboard.html

